  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>FeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>–</mo></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>: Weak field Ligand </p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/34f71cd9-34dc-497d-8ddb-bb50343774d0.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 62px;\"/></p><p>No. of unpaired electrons <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>35</mn></msqrt><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d446078f-7ff5-4dbc-a418-414207973a2a.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 69px;\"/></p><p>No. of unpaired electrons <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> : Weak field Ligand </p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/83032685-fa15-48dc-9c3c-71f48ba2d757.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 68px;\"/></p><p>No. of unpaired electrons <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p>Hence, the answer is option C.</p>",
